def rounded_avg(n: int, m: int) -> str | int:
    """Compute the average of all integers from n to m inclusive, round to the
    nearest integer using round‑half‑to‑even (banker's rounding), and return its
    binary representation. Return -1 if n > m."""
    if n > m:
        return -1

    total = n + m
    if total % 2 == 0:
        avg = total // 2
    else:
        floor_half = total // 2          # = (total - 1) // 2
        # round-half-to-even: if the floor is even, stay; otherwise go up
        avg = floor_half if floor_half % 2 == 0 else floor_half + 1

    return bin(avg)
```

